153
00:08:50,162 --> 00:08:51,163
[SPEAKER_00]: Rising is manifest.

154
00:08:53,685 --> 00:08:55,706
[SPEAKER_00]: Disappearing or passing.

155
00:08:56,687 --> 00:08:58,148
[SPEAKER_00]: Falling is manifest.

