00:08:59,929 --> 00:09:00,609
[SPEAKER_00]: Rising is manifest.

158
00:09:00,629 --> 00:09:01,490
[SPEAKER_00]: Falling... Increasing, decreasing.

159
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:02,851
[SPEAKER_00]: Increasing, decreasing is manifest.

160
00:09:03,191 --> 00:09:07,694
[SPEAKER_00]: Either way, something endures and there's change.

