166
00:09:19,490 --> 00:09:20,191
[SPEAKER_00]: It's completely different.

167
00:09:20,231 --> 00:09:37,002
[SPEAKER_00]: It's, um, uh, this ukuja and nikuja, and that appears quite a lot in the suttas, in the stock phrase, when, um, usually I think it's a householder,

