[SPEAKER_00]: So, this is, this is, this is Udayi saying how amazing how much work he's done in, where is it, insofar as he has pondered over turning around, turning upright, the upside-down-ness of the five assumed abrogates.

189
00:10:32,146 --> 00:10:32,366
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

190
00:10:32,970 --> 00:10:46,804
[SPEAKER_01]: It's actually even probably... because usually I would refer to those examples of when people hear the Buddha and then, oh, it's like turning upside down, putting first to second, but then people can sometimes dismiss that and say, oh, it's just like...

